B.akS=new A.kw("\u2022 No Personal Data Collected: ChronoCraft does not require You to create an account and does not collect, store, sell, or share any personally identifiable information (such as Your name, phone number, email address, contacts, or GPS location) on external servers.\n\u2022 Locally Stored App Data: All clock configurations, alarms, alarm labels, timers, stopwatch laps, selected world clock time zones, and theme/display preferences are stored locally on Your Device. This data never leaves Your Device.",null)
